        "body": "## Summary\nAdvance `data/cbor` from **contract-only** to **reference-implemented**.\n\n- `artifacts/provider.core.wasm` \u2014 flat `key\\tvalue` / LF pairs \u2192 definite-length CBOR map (UTF-8 text keys/values)\n- ABI: `cbor_encode (i32 i32 i32 i32) \u2192 i32`\n- JVM `encode-pairs-wire` / `encode-map` via `ByteArrayOutputStream`\n- **Definition CID unchanged**\n\n## Evidence\n- `clojure -M:test` \u2192 **4 tests / 14 assertions**\n- Node wasm: empty \u2192 `a0`; `a\\tb` \u2192 `a161616162`\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `clojure -M:test`\n- [x] Node `WebAssembly.instantiate` vector check",
